{"id":"sd5vijr2pg9bgyd2johtjpvj0","title":"教学中使用AI写作应包含拒绝权","originalTitle":"Why teaching 'ethical' classroom use of AI to learn writing must include the right to refuse","summary":"教师应引导学生在使用大型语言模型（LLM）如ChatGPT时考虑伦理问题，而不仅仅是提供指导。文章强调，伦理使用AI不应默认为可能，而应鼓励学生思考何时拒绝使用AI。伦理使用AI不仅涉及学术诚信，还应包括环境影响、劳动权益和经济逻辑等多方面考量。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-ethical-classroom-ai.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:10.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T15:43:42.255Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T15:43:42.255Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"69d8ee71-14d6-41bf-8222-1c9100b70e58","title":"AI伦理使用在写作教学中的多维度考量建议"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"69d8ee71-14d6-41bf-8222-1c9100b70e58","title":"AI伦理使用在写作教学中的多维度考量建议"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fkZVb1_nU7n0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}